  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这位优秀的训练家，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可以让我看看你和宝可梦的\n关系好不好吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D4F1879C076848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C00100001BE01000A53EF4EE58BA96211770B770B4F60548C5B9D53EF68A67684000A51737CFB597D4E0D597D5417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请看吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7770B54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "下次吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0B6B2154270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要给我看你和哪只\n宝可梦的关系呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89817ED96211770B4F60548C54EA53EA000A5B9D53EF68A6768451737CFB5462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，\n你的<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001>……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C000A4F6076840010000201010001202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它和你的关系真是非～常地要好呢！\n只要你们在一起就会感到幸福。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83548C4F60768451737CFB771F662F975EFF5E5E3857308981597D5462FF01000A53EA89814F604EEC57284E008D775C314F1A611F52305E78798F30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你很喜欢<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001>，\n不管什么时候都待在它的身边呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605F88559C6B220010000201010001FF0C000A4E0D7BA14EC04E4865F6501990FD5F8557285B8376848EAB8FB95440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你和<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001>\n好像会成为更棒的搭档呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60548C0010000201010001000A597D50CF4F1A62104E3A66F468D27684642D68635462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你们的关系感觉不错呢。\n但你和它的关系应该还能变得更好！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604EEC768451737CFB611F89C94E0D951954623002000A4F464F60548C5B83768451737CFB5E948BE58FD880FD53D85F9766F4597DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "关系稍微变好一点了……\n我感觉是这样。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51737CFB7A0D5FAE53D8597D4E0070B94E8620262026000A6211611F89C9662F8FD9683730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……感觉你们的关系\n还有很长的路要走呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026611F89C94F604EEC768451737CFB000A8FD867095F88957F76848DEF89818D70546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你该不会总是让它\n在对战中晕厥吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BE54E0D4F1A603B662F8BA95B83000A57285BF962184E2D665553A55427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀呀？你对它实施了斯巴达教育吗？\n你们的关系一点都不好呀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE54405440FF1F4F605BF95B835B9E65BD4E8665AF5DF48FBE655980B25417FF1F000A4F604EEC768451737CFB4E0070B990FD4E0D597D544030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你想知道自己和宝可梦的\n关系有多好，就再来找我吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
